ida cada componente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_72":125},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_46":127,"_53":65,"_48":128,"_59":129,"_68":-7,"_13":130,"_70":131},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_72":132},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_46":134,"_53":93,"_68":-7,"_48":135},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_46":137,"_53":65,"_48":138,"_59":139,"_68":-7,"_13":140,"_70":141},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_72":142},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_46":144,"_53":65,"_48":145,"_59":146,"_68":-7,"_13":147,"_70":148},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_72":149},"platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx",{"_46":151,"_53":65,"_48":152,"_59":153,"_68":-7,"_13":154,"_70":155},"es:platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx","Perfiles de certificado","Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles",{"_72":156},"platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx",{"_46":158,"_53":65,"_48":159,"_59":160,"_68":-7,"_13":161,"_70":162},"es:platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx","Jerarquía y rotación","Diseña autoridades raíz e intermedias y sustituye certificados o claves sin romper la confianza.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-37/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation",{"_72":163},"platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx",{"_46":165,"_53":65,"_48":166,"_59":167,"_6